{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>Interest and increase.</b> Explained in the words of tradition [the Sages]. The tav of תרבית is added like the tav of תרמית, and it is from the root רב, except it belongs to the verbs whose lamed is quiescent and hidden, like תכלית, שנאה. Afterward he [also?] explained נשך and תרבית. Also the mem of מרבית is added like the mem of ואבן, משכית."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The phrase 'ופירש הנשך והתרבית אחר כן' is textually difficult: it may mean 'afterward he explained...' with an implied subject, or it may be a gloss that has entered the main text. Translated hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:28.120264624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}